{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"concept maps\" students learning benefits)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_85120615#0_136391845","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3054","rank":2,"snippet":"Catching Graphic Organizer? 5. Conclusion \" , \"segment\": \"Graphic Organizer Examples | EdrawMax Online Graphic Organizer Examples 1. What is A Graphic Organizer The graphic organizer examples are usually helpful tools for students, which act as visual learning strategic tools. These are usually applied across different curriculum and enhance learning as well as understanding of a certain subject matter or content. There are a variety of different formats available, depending on the task. These can act as tools of instructions or graphic organizer examples for elementary <cover>students. Teachers can make use of graphic organizer to illustrate knowledge of a section in a text or topic, also showcasing which are the areas where one needs to improve. The forms of graph organizers are several such as mind maps, concept maps and webs like spider map examples. Source: inspiration.com 2. Benefits of Graphic Organizers There are several ways to benefit from using graphic analyzers in the learning </cover>and teaching processes.\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"Graphic Organizer Examples | EdrawMax Online\" , \"url\": \"https://www.edrawmax.com/graphic-organizer/examples/\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_283931335#15_629153379","rank":1,"relevance":2}]}}
