{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_623701570#0_581601772","relevance":1,"reason":"The page is about conceptual change in education and only mentions concept mapping tools in headings; it does not directly explain how using maps impacts pedagogy.","learned":"Concept-mapping terms can appear only as ancillary resources in broader learning-theory documents, so stronger benefit/strategy terms are needed."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"concept maps\" teaching strategy learning)","reason":"Search for documents where concept maps are treated as a teaching strategy and tied to learning, which is more likely to yield direct evidence on pedagogical impact."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"concept maps\" teaching strategy learning)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_1199153366#3_2443043037","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q3060","rank":1,"snippet":"High-Impact Teaching Strategies FAQs What are evidence-based teaching strategies? What are high-impact teaching strategies? \" , \"segment\": \"Save Source: Australian Society for Evidence-Based Teaching The combination of words and the visual is far more powerful than words alone. For more information, have a look at our article How to Use Visuals & the Modality Effect to Improve Student <cover>Learning. Teaching Strategy 2 – Concept Mapping The second high impact teaching strategy in this article is concept mapping. In an earlier article, on 10 Evidence Based Teaching Strategies, I talked about organising information in a graphical way. Concept mapping is one way to do this that has its own body of supporting research. Save Research also shows that the effect size is larger when your students make their concept maps. </cover>A concept map has 3 main parts: A collection of concepts – normally placed within circles or rectangles The relationships between them – shown with labelled arrows The propositions formed by concept-relationship-concept chains Save You can download an example of a more comprehensive concept map here. Concept mapping is also a potent learning strategy.\" , \"start_char\": 1497.000000"}}
