{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_1022347074#0_2050413175","relevance":3,"reason":"This page is dedicated to GIS/interactive web maps for schools and directly states pedagogical impacts: lessons resonate longer when interactive web maps support K-12 subjects, ArcGIS enables rich lessons and projects, and GIS supports STEM learning through integrative, project-based experiences that provide context.","learned":"Interactive web maps and GIS can affect pedagogy by making lessons more resonant, supporting rich projects, enabling connected-device learning, and providing context for integrative STEM education."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3067","reason":"The GIS education query produced a strong grade-3 result on map-based pedagogy, so continue this result list for more dedicated evidence."}}
